{"contract_version":"2.0.6","id":"p0-kaifeng-procurement-threshold","domain":"law-applicability","prompt":"河南省开封市某市级事业单位使用财政性资金采购集中采购目录外服务80万元，已确认属于政府采购范围。判断是否可以仅因低于100万元而排除政府采购相关规则。","context":{"country":"CN","province":"Henan","city":"Kaifeng","organization_level":"municipal","organization_type":"public_institution","funding":["fiscal_funds"],"government_procurement_scope":true,"in_centralized_catalog":false,"business_type":"service_procurement","amount":800000,"event_date":"2025-06-01"},"expected":{"applicability_status":"applicable","law_ids":["HENAN-GP-2020-DISP-OTHER-MUNICIPAL-GS-500K"],"conclusion_codes":["kaifeng_municipal_threshold_applies"],"exact_fields":["law_ids"]},"notes":"正向适用对象应唯一锁定开封所属其他市级50万元分散采购限额；额外排除信息可补充。","source":"v2-design:P0"}
